# flux-server boolean flags (no value). Mirrors the `bool` fields of crates/spark-server/src/cli.rs.
# A pass-through flag NOT in this set consumes the next token as its value, so
# `--tbt-deadline-ms 100` stays one flag/value pair instead of `100` being taken as the model.
